# Simulation build artifacts. Everything here is regenerated by
# simulation/questa/run_sim.tcl or simulation/verilator/run_sim.sh.
#
# These were previously untracked-but-present in working copies, which is how
# a transcript from a 40-check run and a coverage report with no assertion
# section ended up being cited as current results. Keep them out.

# Questa / ModelSim
work/
transcript
run.log
*.ucdb
*.wlf
*.vstf
modelsim.ini
vsim.dbg
etch*
coverage_report.txt
assert_report.txt
covhtmlreport/

# Verilator
obj_dir/

# Icarus
*.out
*.vvp
*.vcd

# Python (diagram generator, slang checker)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Document build intermediates. The .md and the .pdf are tracked; the HTML
# WeasyPrint is handed is a debugging aid only.
doc/tools/.render_*.html

# Editor / OS
*~
.DS_Store

# Quartus build artifacts (example/de10_lite_rtl/quartus/). Everything here is
# regenerated by a compile; the .qpf/.qsf/.sdc are the tracked sources.
# The .sof is deliberately NOT tracked - a bitstream that drifts from the RTL
# beside it is worse than no bitstream, and it is a two-minute rebuild.
db/
incremental_db/
output_files/
*.qws
*.sof
*.pof
*.rpt
*.summary
*.jdi
*.pin
*.done
*.smsg
*.sld
*.qdf
hc_output/
greybox_tmp/

# Platform Designer and Nios II artifacts (example/de10_lite_nios/).
#
# qsys/build_system.tcl is the source of truth for the Platform Designer
# system, so the .qsys it emits is a build artifact like any other and is NOT
# tracked. An earlier version tracked it, on the grounds that it is what the
# GUI opens - but ./build.sh clean deletes it, and a tracked file that the
# project's own clean target removes is a contradiction. Worse, a committed
# .qsys can drift from the script that claims to generate it, which is exactly
# the failure this repository moved its documents off ODF to avoid.
#
# Run ./build.sh qsys to produce it, then open it in Platform Designer. If you
# change the system there, port the change back into build_system.tcl.
example/de10_lite_nios/qsys/firewall_sys/
example/de10_lite_nios/qsys/firewall_sys.qsys
example/de10_lite_nios/qsys/.qsys_edit/
example/de10_lite_nios/software/bsp/
example/de10_lite_nios/software/obj/
example/de10_lite_nios/software/Makefile
example/de10_lite_nios/software/test/test_firewall_host
*.sopcinfo
*.elf
*.map
*.objdump
